keep_f64_nan0  ¦  20C0400000  ¦  21FFF8000000000000  ¦  2  𝄀
keep_poszero  ¦  2080000000  ¦  218000000000000000  ¦  3  𝄀
update_f32_nan1  ¦  20FFC00001  ¦  21C000000000000000  ¦  1  𝄀
update_f64_nan1  ¦  20C0400000  ¦  21FFF8000000000001  ¦  2  𝄀
update_negzero  ¦  207FFFFFFF  ¦  217FFFFFFFFFFFFFFF  ¦  3
